---
import { getCollection } from "astro:content";
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";

const works = await getCollection("works");
---
<Base title="Reading sample">
  <h1>The stories that might have been.</h1>
  <p>The first sample of the UtopiaUcronia archive, recovered so its texts can be read again.</p>
  <h2>Reading sample</h2>
  {works.length ? <ul class="catalog">{works.map((work) => <li><a href={`/works/${work.id}/`} lang={work.data.language}>{work.data.title}</a><span>{work.data.language.toUpperCase()}</span></li>)}</ul> : <p>Recovery of the first documents is under way. The texts will appear here once the available captures have been checked.</p>}
  <p class="note">This is a conversion trial. Structure, attributions and fidelity of the texts have yet to be compared with the sources.</p>
</Base>
